│ patch_description        │ To improve the model's ability to learn complex decision boundaries, I am increasing the  │
│                          │ expressivity of the ansatz by adding an extra layer of RX gates and expanding the         │
│                          │ entanglement structure. Specifically, I am:                                               │
│                          │ 1. Adding an RX rotation layer to provide additional SU(2) coverage alongside the         │
│                          │ existing RY and RZ layers.                                                                │
│                          │ 2. Expanding the CRZ long-range correlation layer to include jump-2 connections across    │
│                          │ all qubits, increasing connectivity.                                                      │
│                          │ 3. Consolidating the CZ entangler backbone into a more standard full-cycle entanglement   │
│                          │ (0-1, 1-2, ..., 7-0) for better qubit-to-qubit interaction.                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ These changes increase the parameter count per block, which typically improves            │
